    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be a function satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>",
